# Butler Routes - Ashenvale recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and formulas whose SOURCE is physically in
# Ashenvale, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item
# vendor and drop tables). Nine recipes are vendor-sold in-zone; ten more drop
# each from a single Ashenvale mob and nowhere else in the data. Every other
# Ashenvale-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. Tailoring, First Aid, Engineering and Fishing have no Ashenvale
# source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ashenvale-recipes
title Ashenvale - Recipes & Patterns
levels 18-32
zone Ashenvale
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords ashenvale, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — the southeast (Ulthaan)

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 3960 -- Ulthaan (50.01, 66.64), Butcher
  buy 3734 "Recipe: Big Bear Steak"
  buy 5489 "Recipe: Lean Venison"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Leatherworking — the center (Lardan)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 3958 -- Lardan (34.79, 49.84), Leatherworking Supplies
  buy 5973 "Pattern: Barbaric Leggings"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Alchemy — the southeast (Harklan Moongrove)

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 3956 -- Harklan Moongrove (50.84, 67), Alchemy Supplies
  buy 6054 "Recipe: Shadow Protection Potion"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — the west coast (Wik'Tar)

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 12962 -- Wik'Tar (11.71, 34.1), Fish Merchant & Supplies
  buy 6369 "Recipe: Rockscale Cod"
  buy 17062 "Recipe: Mithril Head Trout"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Leatherworking — the southwest (Harlown Darkweave)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 6731 -- Harlown Darkweave (18.23, 60.04), Leatherworking Supplies
  buy 7361 "Pattern: Herbalist's Gloves"
  note Harlown is the only vendor anywhere in the data selling this pattern (he also works the Stonetalon side; this is his Ashenvale point). Stock class is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Enchanting — the center (Dalria)

  when skill Enchanting 1

  vendor 3954 -- Dalria (35.12, 52.12), Trade Goods
  buy 11039 "Formula: Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility"
  buy 11101 "Formula: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength"
  note The Minor Agility formula also drops as a generic world drop, but Dalria sells it here. Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

