step Tailoring, First Aid, Engineering, Fishing — no Ashenvale source

  note The data holds no Tailoring, First Aid, Engineering or Fishing recipe sourced in Ashenvale: no in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. Polestar's own profession guides cover those professions' progression.
